        "officialText": "GRIEVANCE PROCEDURES:\nA grievance is any feeling of dissatisfaction, injustice, or unfair treatment that an employee experiences regarding their working conditions.\nOBJECTIVES OF A GRIEVANCE PROCEDURE:\n\u2022 To help parties resolve grievances quickly at the lowest possible level.\n\u2022 Promotes workplace productivity, harmony, and stability.\n\u2022 Minimizes unfair labor practices and industrial disputes.\n\u2022 Provides an official, constructive platform where workers can voice complaints without fear of victimization.\n\u2022 Promotes a sense of security and fairness among employees.\n\nDISCIPLINARY PROCEDURES:\nDiscipline in the workplace is corrective, not punitive.\nFUNCTIONS OF DISCIPLINARY PROCEDURES:\n\u2022 Bring an employee to an acceptable standard of performance and behavior.\n\u2022 Encourage self-discipline, improvement, and personal responsibility.\n\u2022 Develop the employee into a more productive and reliable team member.\n\u2022 Protect the positive, professional reputation of the security company.\n\u2022 Cultivate a work climate where employees willingly conform to rules and regulations.",
